<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n83483" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πλάνος</span></b>  [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ᾰ], <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span></span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>1.</b>
			
				Act.
			, <i>leading astray, deceiving</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. κατέσειον ἐδωδάν</span> the bait, <i><span class="en">
				Theoc.
				21.43
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				7.702
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Apollonid.
			</span></i>); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. δῶρα, ἄγρα</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Mosch.
				1.29
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Fr.</u>
				1.10
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πνεύματα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>1 Ep.Ti.</u>
					4.1
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			
				Pass.
			, <i>wandering, roaming, fickle</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ποικίλον πρᾶγμ᾽ ἐστὶ καὶ πλάνον τύχη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Men.
					<u>Kith.Fr.</u>
					8
				</span></i>
			 ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. φέγγη</span>
			<i>planets</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Man.
				4.3
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			Subst.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πλάνος, ὁ,</span>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πλάνη</span>
			, <i>wandering, roaming</i>, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>OC</u>
				1114
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Alc.</u>
				482
			</span></i>, etc.: in pl., <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>V.</u>
				873
			</span></i> (lyr.), etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>b.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κερκίδος πλάνοι</span>, of the act of
			weaving, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Ion</u>
				1491
			</span></i> (lyr.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			metaph., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φροντίδος πλάνοι</span>
			<i>wanderings</i> of thought, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>OT</u>
				67
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. φρενῶν</span>
			<i>wandering</i> of mind, madness, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Hipp.</u>
				283
			</span></i> ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. τε καρδίᾳ προσίσταται</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					1038
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πλάνοις</span>
			<i>in uncertain fits</i>, of a disease, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Ph.</u>
				758
			</span></i>; 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πλάνη</span>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				11.1
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Phd.</u>
				79d
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>digression</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Ep.</u>
				344d
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b>
			<i>error</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ceb.
				25
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Diog.Oen.
				26
			</span></i> ; <i>grammatical mistake</i>, <i><span class="en">
				A.D.
				<u>Pron.</u>
				84.11
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b> of persons,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πλάνος, ὁ</span>, <i>vagabond,impostor</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Nicostr.Com.
				24
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Dionys.Com.
				4
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.S.
				34
			</span></i>/<i><span class="en">
				5.2.14
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ev.Matt.</u>
				27.63
			</span></i>.</div>
